    #
    # WHY THIS ARM EXISTS. heimdall-sla shipped 2026-08-08 with no caller of any kind:
    # no hook, no arm, named only from prose. `heimdall-deadcode` classified it
    # PROSE-ONLY. So for two weeks the rule was documented and structurally
    # unenforceable, and the first run after wiring found 79 breaches out of 84
    # scanned with 0 triaged. A queue that can age silently is the same defect class
    # as a monitor that can stop silently — this arm is the invocable path that makes
    # the rule checkable by a human instead of merely written down.
    #
    # Titles are withheld by heimdall-sla itself unless --verbose: observation titles
    # carry live secrets, and this repo's standing constraint is that a security
