    # hmd no longer hard-depends on that plugin for compression to function;
    # see CLAUDE.md "Token Efficiency" for why. This is level OWNERSHIP, not
    # enforcement -- a hook can only inject text, never verify the model
    # followed it. For the measured read-back, see `caveman-audit` below.
